   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = 2 x^{3} + 6 x + 12 \\). Find the value of c in the open interval \\( (0, 2) \\) at which the instantaneous rate of change of f equals the average rate of change of f over \\( \\left[0, 2\\right] \\). Give the exact value.",
