      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The solutions are \\( c = \\pm \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{3} \\). Only \\( c = \\frac{2 \\sqrt{3}}{3} \\) lies in \\( (0, 2) \\), so that is the value.",
